# 💡 Interview Tips

✅ Queue follows FIFO.

✅ Circular Queue prevents memory wastage.

✅ Deque allows insertion/deletion from both ends.

✅ Priority Queue is generally implemented using a Heap.

✅ STL Queue provides efficient built-in operations.

